{"id":"torrey:locust-the","source":"torrey","name":"Locust, The","slug":"locust-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"A small insect — Pr 30:24,27.","refs":[["Prov",30,24,30,24],["Prov",30,27,30,27]]},{"text":"Clean and fit for food — Le 11:21,22.","refs":[["Lev",11,21,11,21],["Lev",11,22,11,22]]},{"text":"Wise. — Pr 30:24,27.","refs":[["Prov",30,24,30,24],["Prov",30,27,30,27]]},{"text":"Voracious. — Ex 10:15.","refs":[["Exod",10,15,10,15]]},{"text":"Rapid in movement. — Isa 33:4.","refs":[["Isa",33,4,33,4]]},{"text":"Like to horses prepared for battle. — Joe 2:4; Re 9:7.","refs":[["Joel",2,4,2,4],["Rev",9,7,9,7]]},{"text":"Carried every way by the wind — Ex 10:13,19.","refs":[["Exod",10,13,10,13],["Exod",10,19,10,19]]},{"text":"Immensely numerous — Ps 105:34; Na 3:15.","refs":[["Ps",105,34,105,34],["Nah",3,15,3,15]]},{"text":"Flies in bands and with order — Pr 30:27.","refs":[["Prov",30,27,30,27]]},{"text":"One of the plagues of Egypt — Ex 10:4-15.","refs":[["Exod",10,4,10,15]]},{"text":"Used as food. — Mt 3:4.","refs":[["Matt",3,4,3,4]]},{"text":"Threatened with, as a punishment for sin. — De 28:38,42.","refs":[["Deut",28,38,28,38],["Deut",28,42,28,42]]},{"text":"Deprecated the plague of. — 1Ki 8:37,38.","refs":[["1Kgs",8,37,8,37],["1Kgs",8,38,8,38]]},{"text":"Often plagued by. — Joe 1:4; 2:25.","refs":[["Joel",1,4,1,4],["Joel",2,25,2,25]]},{"text":"Promised deliverance from the plague of, on humiliation, &c. — 2Ch 7:13,14.","refs":[["2Chr",7,13,7,13],["2Chr",7,14,7,14]]},{"text":"Of destructive enemies. — Joe 1:6,7; 2:2-9.","refs":[["Joel",1,6,1,6],["Joel",1,7,1,7],["Joel",2,2,2,9]]},{"text":"Of false teachers of the apostasy. — Re 9:3.","refs":[["Rev",9,3,9,3]]},{"text":"Of ungodly rulers. — Na 3:17.","refs":[["Nah",3,17,3,17]]},{"text":"(Destruction of,) of destruction of God’s enemies. — Na 3:15.","refs":[["Nah",3,15,3,15]]}],"refCount":31}
